  "releaseNotes": "v7.0.0: Requires Abstractions v3.0.0, VectorDb.InMemory v3.0.0, and Rag.Abstractions v6.0.0 — VectorFilter.ByMetadata/ByNamespace/ByScope and MetadataMatch are removed. Users of RagQueryOptions.StoreFilter must migrate to new fluent API: new VectorFilter().Where(...). Internal MergeStoreFilter uses AppendConditionsFrom; DeleteDocumentAsync uses .Where().",
